{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 47","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the midpoint of line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> units long, a perpendicular <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/77706943210a5dbe1ee238f65c0cd2e9bb0b7050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MR$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> is erected with length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> units. An arc is described from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> with a radius equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/22507c67d1f1033f5f1f02d7b8c896e28ee59f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"40\" height=\"37\" />, meeting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d5b93dbd5e47d3865c56f03ec1213bb82256a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AT$\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/2/0c24f95fda0ea2207182fc089fbe14b6750570e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TB$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> are the roots of:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d0929f84dae602fc642ce59e05fe5ce2f150dda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x^2+px+q^2=0\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ x^2-px+q^2=0\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ x^2+px-q^2=0\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ x^2-px-q^2=0\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ x^2-px+q=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"166\" height=\"98\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/3/7a39fde7523763fbba5387b61013d056f83274c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AT + TB = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" />. Note, also, that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd508033a65c5b5cb60be7e7a914a38ad0cb05b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AT * TB = (AM - TM) * (BM + TM) = (AM - TM) * (AM + TM) = AM^2 - TM^2 = TR^2 - TM^2 = MR^2 = q^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"918\" height=\"19\" />. Therefore, by Vieta's formulas, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b84172284c4317c4b4fdeeae0d9aba38ebcdc2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - AT)(x - TB) = x^2 - px + q^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"269\" height=\"19\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" /> and we are done.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">Problem 46</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">Problem 48</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 2